+# CLI commands
+
+- Register CommandDefs in `commands.ts`; `run.ts` builds the command
+  tree from that registry. Add child commands through `subcommands`.
+- Declare command-local options with `global:false` so a group's flags
+  do not become accepted options for its child commands. Integer options
+  use string parsing to preserve decimal-only validation.
+- Use `textBytes` for stored report bytes so invalid UTF-8 remains
+  visibly escaped. Decoding to a string first loses the original bytes.
+- CLI tests use `runRoast`. Tests that touch run records also use
+  `test/record/repo.ts` to chdir and isolate home/config directories.
+  Import new test modules in `test/index.ts`.
